        {"id": "bound-cycle", "title": {"en": "Slow bounding", "de": "Langsamer Sprunglauf"}, "description": {"en": "A slow, stotting-like bound: the hind pair pushes and the fore pair lands in overlapping stances (55 % of the cycle each), so the body is always supported; the back arches and stretches and the head bobs. The flight phase of a fast roe bound is deliberately omitted.", "de": "Ein langsamer Sprunglauf: das Hinterlaufpaar drückt ab und das Vorderlaufpaar landet in sich überlappenden Standphasen (je 55 % des Zyklus), der Körper ist also stets abgestützt; der Rücken wölbt und streckt sich und der Kopf wippt. Die Flugphase eines schnellen Rehsprungs ist bewusst ausgelassen."}, "durationS": 0.9, "fps": 30, "loop": true, "rootMotion": "plant", "advanceM": 0.6775, "keys": [{"t": 0.0, "pose": "bound-phase-0", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.1125, "pose": "bound-phase-1", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.225, "pose": "bound-phase-2", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.3375, "pose": "bound-phase-3", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.45, "pose": "bound-phase-4", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.5625, "pose": "bound-phase-5", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.675, "pose": "bound-phase-6", "ease": "smooth"}, {"t": 0.7875, "pose": "bound-phase-7", "ease": "smooth"}], "contacts": [{"anchor": "contact-hn", "fromS": 0.0, "toS": 0.495}, {"anchor": "contact-hf", "fromS": 0.027, "toS": 0.522}, {"anchor": "contact-fn", "fromS": 0.45, "toS": 0.9}, {"anchor": "contact-fn", "fromS": 0, "toS": 0.045}, {"anchor": "contact-ff", "fromS": 0.477, "toS": 0.9}, {"anchor": "contact-ff", "fromS": 0, "toS": 0.072}], "phases": [{"id": "hind-drive", "fromS": 0, "toS": 0.45, "title": {"en": "Hind pair drives", "de": "Hinterlaufpaar drückt ab"}}, {"id": "fore-landing", "fromS": 0.45, "toS": 0.9, "title": {"en": "Fore pair lands and carries", "de": "Vorderlaufpaar landet und trägt"}}], "events": [{"t": 0.0, "kind": "contact-on", "title": {"en": "Near hind hoof touches down", "de": "Nahe Hinterhuf setzt auf"}, "target": "contact-hn